{"title": "Malefic Funghi", "pageid": 28200, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Malefic_Funghi", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Malefic Funghi</b> is a passive feature that boosts a druid's spells and damage.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>The wearer gains a +1 bonus to <a href=\"/wiki/Spell_Save_DC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Spell Save DC\">Spell Save DC</a> and when dealing <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Necrotic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">Necrotic</span></a> damage, they deal an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">1</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Necrotic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">Necrotic</span></a> damage. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_of_the_Sporekeeper\" title=\"Armour of the Sporekeeper\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b3/Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b3/Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b3/Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b3/Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b3/Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_of_the_Sporekeeper\" title=\"Armour of the Sporekeeper\">Armour of the Sporekeeper</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Since elemental damage from several sources is additive in one instance, <b>Malefic Funghi</b> only provides 1 extra damage regardless of the number of sources of necrotic damage. For example, a <a href=\"/wiki/Vampire_Ascendant\" title=\"Vampire Ascendant\">Vampire Ascendant</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Astarion\" title=\"Astarion\">Astarion</a> with <a href=\"/wiki/Manifestation_of_Body\" title=\"Manifestation of Body\">Manifestation of Body</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Symbiotic_Entity\" title=\"Symbiotic Entity\">Symbiotic Entity</a> active deals only 1 extra necrotic damage with this armour equipped, despite having three separate sources of necrotic damage.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714210700\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.045 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.051 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1366/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 12705/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5028/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 817908/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   44.890      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   44.890      1 -total\n 33.89%   15.214      2 Template:Icon_link\n 32.76%   14.706      2 Template:Icon_text\n 31.80%   14.277     18 Template:Trim\n 29.98%   13.456      1 Template:DamageType\n 22.85%   10.257      4 Template:Ifempty\n 22.54%   10.119      1 Template:Passive_equipment_list\n 18.12%    8.133      1 Template:Passive_sources/format\n 16.11%    7.233      1 Template:MdRarityItem\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:28200-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714210700 and revision id 397355. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}